    "語の中で from:@名前、in:#チャンネル、before:2026-09-01、has:file、is:thread、is:times のような条件も使えます。is:times は参加していない公開の times も探します。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can also use filters among the words, such as from:@name, in:#channel, before:2026-09-01, has:file, is:thread, is:times. is:times also searches public times channels you haven't joined."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在词语中还可以使用 from:@名字、in:#频道、before:2026-09-01、has:file、is:thread、is:times 等条件。is:times 也会搜索未加入的公开 times 频道。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
