    "毎時 0 分から %lld 時間まで、2 週間先まで。予約・順番待ち・利用中は 1 つの枠で 1 人 1 つまで。「今すぐ」は空いている枠を次の予約が始まるまで使えます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "From the top of the hour for up to %lld hours, up to 2 weeks ahead. One booking, queue place or seat per person in a slot. “Now” uses a free slot until the next booking starts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
